                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "195725891",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198031993506",
                            "num_reviews": 6,
                            "playtime_forever": 34,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 34,
                            "last_played": 1748291790
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Although there doesn't seem to be anyone playing right now at the time of this review the game does have me interested in its future..\n\nThe concept of players dying and returning as The Cursed to hunt the other players is sort of a nice twist in this genre, although I'm no expert in these type of games so it might have been done before.\n\nArmed with just a torchlight, you and 4 others play as a cultist trying to complete a ritual. To fully complete the ritual you will have to brave the dark woods and complete certain objectives but beware, it seems you are not alone and there are monsters and malevolent spirits out to harm you. If a player is captured and left to rot by his/her teammates then he/she can come back as The Cursed and deliver pain and suffering to their former teammates. \n\nCompleting the ritual by the cultist will make turn them into vampires who's main objective will be now to defeat The Cursed - the former hunters.\n\nGame-play aside, the atmosphere and visuals are the major draw for me. The way the music changes when you turn into Vampire gets me really pumped up. \n\nI wouldn't be surprised if the devs are Vampire The Masquerade fans because it reminds of VTMB: Blood Hunt, a game dearly loved by me and my cousin. Sadly the game just couldn't retain its player-base in the long run due to slow bug fixes which greatly affected the pvp experience.\n\nI hope this game does really well in future and wish the devs good luck and I will be checking it out every now and then.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1748294420,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1748294524,
                        "voted_up": true,
                        "votes_up": 36,
                        "votes_funny": 1,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.7808707356452942,
                        "comment_count": 0,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": true,
                        "developer_response": "Thanks a lot for the kind words and detailed review! We're definitely working hard behind the scenes to grow the game and bring in more players. It's awesome to hear you liked the twist of turning into The Cursed and later into a Vampire! We’ll keep refining things. See you in the dark river! <3",
                        "timestamp_dev_responded": 1748296660,
                        "primarily_steam_deck": false,
                        "refunded": false
                    }
